          "original": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/254/637284.jpg"
        },
        "summary": "<p>The third season of the award-winning drama continues the story of two women with brutal pasts, addicted to each other but now trying desperately to live their lives without their drug of choice. For Villanelle, the assassin without a job, Eve is dead. For Eve, the ex-MI6 operative hiding in plain sight, Villanelle will never find her. All seems fine until a shocking and personal death sets them on a collision course yet again. The journey back to each other will cost both of them friends, family, and allegiances... and perhaps a share of their souls.</p><p><br /> </p>",
        "_links": {
